flowchart TD
    AUTH[Package B start authorization]
    BASE[Current governed base]
    PARKED[Parked stale DPA-800 branch]
    DRAFT[DPA-800 draft]

    DP1[DP1 Proof of Architecture]
    DISC[Discovery read-only inventory]
    PROBE[Probe exact-ref compatibility tests]
    P001[PROBE-001 registry and contracts]
    P002[PROBE-002 lifecycle and state]
    P003[PROBE-003 workflow serialization]
    P004[PROBE-004 migration and rollback]
    RPROBE[Renderer Probes]
    ASSESS[Assessment adjudication]

    DP2[DP2 first production projection]
    DP3[DP3 controlled rollout]
    DP4[DP4 status-authority migration or no migration]
    DP5[DP5 staged strict gates]
    IMPORT[Controlled import mapping]

    BLOCK[Blocked stop state]
    EVID[Bounded evidence]
    MAINT[Maintainer adjudication]

    AUTH --> BASE
    BASE --> DRAFT
    PARKED -. excluded .-> DRAFT
    DRAFT --> DP1

    DP1 --> DISC
    DISC -->|facts only| PROBE
    PROBE --> P001
    PROBE --> P002
    PROBE --> P003
    PROBE --> P004
    PROBE --> RPROBE
    P001 -->|PASS/FAIL/PARTIAL/BLOCKED| ASSESS
    P002 -->|PASS/FAIL/PARTIAL/BLOCKED| ASSESS
    P003 -->|PASS/FAIL/PARTIAL/BLOCKED| ASSESS
    P004 -->|PASS/FAIL/PARTIAL/BLOCKED| ASSESS
    RPROBE -->|PASS/FAIL/PARTIAL/BLOCKED| ASSESS
    ASSESS -->|accepted and nonblocking| DP2
    ASSESS -->|missing evidence or contradiction| BLOCK

    DP2 -->|accepted first target and exit criteria| DP3
    DP2 -->|blocked implementation| BLOCK
    DP3 -->|per-target evidence and exit criteria| DP4
    DP3 -->|unbounded rollout| BLOCK
    DP4 -->|migration or no migration exit criteria| DP5
    DP4 -->|reader/writer/rollback unproven| BLOCK
    DP5 -->|observe/warn/block-new/strict exit criteria| IMPORT
    DP5 -->|strict unsafe| BLOCK

    DISC --> EVID
    PROBE --> EVID
    ASSESS --> EVID
    DP2 --> EVID
    DP3 --> EVID
    DP4 --> EVID
    DP5 --> EVID
    EVID --> MAINT
    BLOCK --> EVID

    NOTE1[No Probe execution in the Lab draft]
    NOTE2[No DP2 mutation before Probe and Assessment]
    NOTE3[No wholesale Lab import]
    NOTE4[Exact refs cannot be silently promoted]
    NOTE5[Generated Kit outputs change through source or command contract]

    NOTE1 -. boundary .-> PROBE
    NOTE2 -. gate .-> DP2
    NOTE3 -. boundary .-> IMPORT
    NOTE4 -. evidence .-> EVID
    NOTE5 -. boundary .-> DP4
